# The book's multi-part song (v0.26): the Ode to Joy lesson is the
# melody; the other parts are generated at build time from the
# chart by tools/lessons2c.py (see format.md, "Songs"). Parts are
# listed in learning order. The firmware only plays what it is
# given; nothing is generated at runtime. The title carries its
# "(Song)" suffix in the data (v0.30): the song is the book's
# first entry now, and the suffix is what tells its sheets apart
# from the Ode to Joy lesson's.
title:    Ode to Joy (Song)
melody:   l02-ode-to-joy.lesson
chart:    C | G | F | C
parts:    percussion bass harmony melody
